Requirement 2
Verify the complete toolchain is operational by running one functional check per tool: pull alpine:latest with Docker, scan it with Trivy for HIGH and CRITICAL CVEs, lint any valid single-line Dockerfile with Hadolint, and scan alpine:latest with Dockle. All four commands must exit without a fatal error (non-zero exit caused by a tool crash, not by findings).

docker pull alpine:latest
trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL alpine:latest
echo "FROM alpine:latest" | hadolint -
